    s1["1. Traveler request<br/>User supplies trip details and explicit preferences"]
    s2["2. Load current memory<br/>Session · entity profile · conversation · workflow outcomes · retrieved tools"]
    s3["3. Construct the context<br/>Stable cached prefix → changing memory suffix"]
    s4["4. Count tokens and compact<br/>Host threshold + agent-requested compaction"]
    s5["5. Model chooses an action<br/>Raw Anthropic · cache read/write usage is visible"]
    s6["6. Retrieve, search or call a tool<br/>Oracle HNSW → reranker · Tavily live web search · toolbox tools"]
    s7["7. Offload and record<br/>Full tool payload → compressed Oracle object · success/failure event"]
    s8["8. Read details just in time<br/>ID + description → unpack summary or original result"]
    s9["9. Grounded research shortlist<br/>Actual source links · no invented fares or reservations"]
    s1 --> s2
    s2 --> s3
    s3 --> s4
    s4 --> s5
    s5 --> s6
    s6 --> s7
